  "title": "Qt: Use the last related framenum symbol instead of first",
  "description": "Before 1bbac91d33ea9711de1dd052fea74cbaff72761f the last related\npacket symbol was used instead of the first.\n\nCurrently the first related packet symbol is used, and not overridden\nwith a new one. It's probably more interesting to prefer the last\nFT_FRAMENUM fields added, e.g. a Request/Response relationship from\nan application layer is more interesting than an ACK relationship from\nTCP.\n\nThis still might not be optimal; we might want a more complicated\norder of precedence, or else try to draw more than one.",
